163
00:09:56.762 --> 00:09:59.932
Moscow Police Department.
If you're in here. announce yourself.

164
00:10:05.313 --> 00:10:06.480
Moscow Police Department.

165
00:10:16.574 --> 00:10:17.575
[officer 2] Fuck.

166
00:10:18.117 --> 00:10:21.287
-[officer 1] Police Department.
-[officer 2] On the third floor. going up.

167
00:10:29.337 --> 00:10:30.212
Hey. puppy.

168
00:10:30.296 --> 00:10:31.714
[sighs]

169
00:10:32.465 --> 00:10:33.507
Oh. man…

170
00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:36.927
[sighs]

171
00:10:37.595 --> 00:10:39.472
-Fuck. dude.
-[officer 1] Yeah.

172
00:10:43.434 --> 00:10:46.103
[officer 3] Forty-Six. Thirteen.
Let me know when 1-0-2 arrives.

173
00:10:47.063 --> 00:10:51.442
[officer 1] Thirteen. we have two
