174
00:10:52.902 --> 00:10:53.944
[officer 2] I copy.

175
00:10:54.028 --> 00:10:56.197
[moody music playing]

176
00:11:02.161 --> 00:11:05.247
-[officer 1] Careful. it's. uh…
-[officer 2] Yeah. we're gonna need…

177
00:11:06.248 --> 00:11:08.459
