179
00:11:18.928 --> 00:11:20.137
Oh. boy.

180
00:11:20.221 --> 00:11:23.974
Justin Olson's gonna come pick this dog up
and take him to the pound for us.

181
00:11:25.017 --> 00:11:28.104
Come on.
Do you mind holding on to him a second?

182
00:11:28.187 --> 00:11:29.814
[indistinct chatter]

183
00:11:29.897 --> 00:11:32.024
[officer 4] Moscow 120. Same traffic.

184
