[operator] I copy. and just
to keep you updated. per radio traffic.

185
00:11:35.528 --> 00:11:38.864
it sounds like they found
two additional deceased in the house.

186
00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:45.121
[Anthony] That day. I was at home.
It was my day off.

187
00:11:45.204 --> 00:11:47.707
I got the phone call.
I was not the on-call commander.

188
00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:50.668
so I knew that phone call
was probably not a good thing.

189
00:11:51.544 --> 00:11:53.421
I definitely did not expect to hear

190
00:11:53.504 --> 00:11:56.924
that we had not only a homicide.
but a quadruple homicide.

191
00:11:57.007 --> 00:12:00.761
Without going into too much detail.
it was absolutely horrific.

192
00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:06.392
It was immediately apparent that all four
had succumbed to stab wounds

193
00:12:06.892 --> 00:12:08.728
as a likely cause of death.

194
00:12:10.271 --> 00:12:12.940
That's something
that nobody expects to ever see

195
00:12:13.023 --> 00:12:15.943
and something you can never unsee
once you see it.

196
00:12:16.026 --> 00:12:17.945
I know not only myself.

197
00:12:18.028 --> 00:12:20.740
but every officer
that was involved that day.

198
00:12:20.823 --> 00:12:22.950
