199
00:12:24.034 --> 00:12:25.745
[officer 1] I walked all the way around

200
00:12:25.828 --> 00:12:28.914
and didn't see any blood anywhere.
or anything like that.

201
00:12:33.669 --> 00:12:36.213
[Anthony] Our detective sergeant.
when he arrived on scene.

202
00:12:36.297 --> 00:12:38.799
he recognized that this was a major event.

203
00:12:38.883 --> 00:12:41.552
He immediately called
our partners at the Idaho State Police

204
00:12:41.635 --> 00:12:44.054
and asked them to come up and assist.

205
00:12:44.138 --> 00:12:45.598
[officer 1] I'm guessing you're…

206
00:12:45.681 --> 00:12:49.268
[Anthony] This was so outside anything
that we had dealt with

207
00:12:49.351 --> 00:12:50.644
